{"2980760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VERTIG8", "steam_appid": 2980760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Vertig8.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertig8 is a <strong>third-person vertical shooter</strong> set inside a massive skyscraper where height itself becomes the battlefield. Each floor brings new risks, tighter spaces, and fresh opportunities to outplay your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first mode integrated into the game is <strong>Last Man Standing</strong>—a high-stakes fight for survival where only one player or team reaches the top. More modes will follow, but this marks the starting point of Vertig8’s ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark ambients, vertical progression, and floor-by-floor combat create a tense multiplayer experience unlike anything else. Flashlights cut through the shadows, and every decision—whether to climb, hold, or fight—can mean victory or elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertig8 isn’t just about shooting. It’s about mastering vertical combat, adapting to unpredictable encounters, and proving you can survive the skyscraper.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Vertig8.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertig8 is a <strong>third-person vertical shooter</strong> set inside a massive skyscraper where height itself becomes the battlefield. Each floor brings new risks, tighter spaces, and fresh opportunities to outplay your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first mode integrated into the game is <strong>Last Man Standing</strong>—a high-stakes fight for survival where only one player or team reaches the top. More modes will follow, but this marks the starting point of Vertig8’s ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark ambients, vertical progression, and floor-by-floor combat create a tense multiplayer experience unlike anything else. Flashlights cut through the shadows, and every decisio